# Copy to `.env` and fill in from your Supabase project:
# Dashboard -> Project Settings -> Data API (URL) and API Keys (anon key).
#
# Leaving these unset is fine: the app falls back to storing your wardrobe in
# this browser only, and offers to move it into your account once you sign in.
#
# Both values are safe in a browser bundle. The anon key is designed to be
# public -- row-level security in the migration is what protects your data.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
